   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Countdown Timer**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Intrasport**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-12-05** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 139 min [1]. Said about its sound: Listener questions if the file is lossless, citing YouTube compression issues [3]\n- **kglw2025-12-05.SBD**: soundboard; 18 songs; 127 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Pre-Show [1]\n- Stu shouted, 'I love heavy metal!' while performing this song [2]\n- Joey thanked Jimi Hendrix following the performance of this track [2]\n- Uncle Michael West introduced the band before they took the stage [2]\n- Dimathaya Burarrwanga and Ngalakan 'Billy' Wanambi played yiḏaki during the show [2]\n- The tuneup for this song included a tease of Hot Water [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-12-05**: source: YT stream [1]\n- **kglw2025-12-05.SBD**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joseph Santarpia; source: SBD [2]",
